# The code-review bot parses these as literal glob patterns, but Prettier formats them as
# Markdown: it escapes `*` to `\*` and reads `*...*` as emphasis, rewriting it to `_..._`.
# That silently emptied every backend and web pattern in commit 5103dbe, and the bot skipped
# every file on both platforms for 14 merged pull requests before anyone noticed. `apple/`
# escaped only because it is ignored above.
review-rules/

# Same reasoning one level up: `.bb/AGENTS.md` and `.bb/skills/` are injected into every
# agent thread verbatim, and `.claude/` above is already excluded for the same reason.
# Keeping the formatter out of them means a table or a glob written here is what the
# agent actually reads.
.bb/
